  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "わたあめのような　あまくて　ベタつく\nしろい　いとを　だして　あいてを\nからめとり　うごきを　ふうじる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "솜사탕 같은 달고 끈적끈적한\n하얀 실을 내뿜어 상대를\n휘감고 움직이지 못하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il immobilise son adversaire à l’aide de filaments\nblancs, sucrés et collants qui ressemblent à de la\nbarbe à papa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es stößt weiße Fäden aus, die so süß und klebrig wie\nZuckerwatte sind. Mit ihnen umwickelt es den Gegner\nund hindert ihn daran, sich zu bewegen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escupe hebras pegajosas de color blanco y textura\nparecida a la del algodón de azúcar, con las que\nenvuelve al enemigo y le impide que se mueva.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Immobilizza il nemico avvolgendolo in filamenti\nbianchi, dolci e appiccicosi, simili a zucchero filato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "To entangle its opponents in battle, it extrudes\nwhite threads as sweet and sticky as cotton candy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "わたあめのような　甘くて　ベタつく\n白い　糸を　出して\n相手を　絡め取り　動きを　封じる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escupe hebras pegajosas de color blanco y textura\nparecida a la del algodón de azúcar, con las que\nenvuelve al enemigo y le impide que se mueva.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あまいもの　ばかりを　たべているので\nたいもうが　わたあめのように\nあまく　ベタベタしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "달콤한 것만 먹기 때문에\n몸의 털이 솜사탕처럼\n달고 끈적끈적하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se gave de sucreries à longueur de journée, à tel\npoint que sa fourrure finit par ressembler à de la barbe\nà papa, sucrée et poisseuse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es frisst nur Süßigkeiten, weshalb sein Fell so süß\nund klebrig wie Zuckerwatte ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Como se alimenta exclusivamente de dulces, su\npelaje es tan pegajoso y dulzón como el algodón\nde azúcar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Poiché mangia solo cose dolci, il suo pelo ha\nla consistenza e il sapore dello zucchero filato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Because it eats nothing but sweets,\nits fur is as sticky sweet as cotton candy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
